<title>UK: UK Post Office faces busiest Xmas mailbag.</title>
<headline>UK Post Office faces busiest Xmas mailbag.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Post Office said on Friday it expected the biggest Christmas mailbag ever this year, with nearly two billion letters and cards being handled.</p>
<p>Monday is expected to be the most popular day for cards to be posted and mail volumes will be nearly double the normal daily 70 million letters.</p>
<p>In a statement, the Post Office said cards should be posted before Monday to avoid them being delayed.</p>
</text>
